Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.19,0:00:05.06,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,What? It's his birthday today?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.06,0:00:06.03,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.03,0:00:07.16,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,That's great to hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.16,0:00:12.41,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Imagine giving him a birthday gift when \Nyou're alone together enjoying the night view!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.41,0:00:13.25,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,The night view?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.25,0:00:14.02,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.73,0:00:15.64,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:19.83,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I haven't the slightest clue what to give him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.73,0:00:23.12,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,What does he like?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:25.43,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,What he likes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.43,0:00:27.08,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.08,0:00:30.17,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Katsuda Side Dish Store's tonkatsu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.17,0:00:34.05,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Hm... That might not have quite \Nthe right impact as a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.05,0:00:35.80,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,What else...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.67,0:00:42.06,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Dolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.81,0:00:45.06,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs21\bord2\fnArial Black\c&H3A25D0&\3c&H2D2620&}Kiyobashi Camera {\c&HB3A99A&}Multimedia, Kikyoji Store
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.89,0:00:50.19,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Oh, when you mentioned dolls, \Nyou meant figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:50.19,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs14\bord2\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H5F49E1&\frz357.1\fax0.05\pos(360,88)}Toys & Figures
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.19,0:00:53.89,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,He has these "hero" figures on his shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.89,0:00:57.76,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Oh, okay... So what kinds \Nof heroes does he like?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:00:59.16,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:03.04,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,937)\fnArial Black\bord2\c&HFEFEFE&\3c&H516A74&}Capsule Toy Section
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.19,0:01:02.31,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Oh, I believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:06.21,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(903,1)\bord2\fnArial Black\an7\fs16\c&H5A9B4F&\3c&HE2FFF2&\pos(49.5,63.5)}Succulent
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:06.21,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fad(903,1)\fnTimes New Roman\fs16\c&H14111A&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(311.5,60)}Happy Murderous\NInstinct Friends
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:06.21,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnComic Sans MS\fad(903,1)\an9\fs16\c&H696866&\3c&HF6FAFC&\pos(602,67.5)}Dancing Haniwa
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.10,0:01:06.21,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,I saw that one in Master Hitoyoshi's room!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.21,0:01:08.04,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,This is a capsule toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:12.83,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,You can get a random toy \Nin the picture for 300 yen a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.83,0:01:15.02,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,So in order to get this black one...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.01,0:01:18.34,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\fs16\c&H14111A&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(357,29.5)}Happy Murderous\NInstinct Friends
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.02,0:01:18.34,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,You have to keep trying until \Nthe one you want comes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.79,0:01:21.08,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Are you going to try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.98,0:01:22.80,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:56.03,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\bord2\c&HFBFBF7&\3c&H111F31&\fax0.25\pos(173.5,164.5)\frz358}Capsule Toy Section
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:56.03,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs20\c&H19188C&\3c&H71CDE0&\frz28.55\fax-0.35\pos(501,57.5)}Exchange
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.42,0:03:00.57,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Another Crystal...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.05,0:03:03.77,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.20,0:03:05.82,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,No matter what I do, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:08.16,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Oh! Ms. Yuki, your nose...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:09.16,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Your nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.16,0:03:13.60,DefaultTop,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm not even worthy of giving \NMaster Hitoyoshi a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.66,0:03:13.67,Signs_EpTitle,CAPTION,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,474)\pos(604.5,285.5)\blur1}Episode {\c&H132AD6&}12{\c&H000000&}: The Joyous Tidings {\c&H132AD6&}You All{\c&H000000&} Bring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.59,0:03:16.33,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Um, Miss...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.90,0:03:22.38,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Shall I teach you a spell you can chant \Nwhen something you want eludes you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.81,0:03:24.41,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,A spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.41,0:03:25.18,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:27.27,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Firstly...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:29.42,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Banish those tears!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.42,0:03:32.13,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,These machines are embodiments \Nof evil that prey on the weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.13,0:03:34.03,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,You can't just rely on the gods to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.61,0:03:34.56,DefaultTop,NAKA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.03,0:03:35.98,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,If you want it, seize it with your own hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.98,0:03:38.34,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,The desire sensor is a hoax!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.34,0:03:39.78,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Steel your heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.78,0:03:42.99,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,and pull the handle with killing intent!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.99,0:03:43.53,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.53,0:03:46.90,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,S-Steel my heart with killing intent...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.87,0:03:49.54,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,"Come home, or die!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.54,0:03:51.65,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,When you pull, you must make that your mantra!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.65,0:03:53.17,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! I'll give it a try!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:54.54,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,You're really trying it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.94,0:04:03.88,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Come home...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:06.10,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.91,0:04:09.18,DefaultItalics,NAKA {M},0,0,0,,H-Her killing intent is overwhelming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.19,0:04:15.42,Default,ARATA AND NAKA,0,0,0,,Gulp...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.65,0:04:20.75,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,H-He came home!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.75,0:04:22.70,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,G-Glad it worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.43,0:04:26.66,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I-I can't thank you enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:32.60,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,No worries. I was thinking about how \NI used to tell my son the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.60,0:04:34.12,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,So I couldn't just sit back and watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.12,0:04:36.33,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,I'm glad I was able to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.66,0:04:40.66,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Well, I'd better get back to my shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.55,0:04:44.32,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,He was as kind as he was handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.32,0:04:46.58,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,He did seem most considerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.15,0:04:50.47,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Big Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.47,0:04:51.80,DefaultTop,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ack?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.47,0:04:52.31,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Chop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:56.01,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,It's already snack time! \NJust how long are you gonna sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.01,0:04:58.86,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh? What happened \Nto the New Year's shrine visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.86,0:05:00.85,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Never mind that! \NDad's gonna be here any second!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.85,0:05:02.08,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What? Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.61,0:05:04.74,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs17\an9\fnComic Sans MS\c&H424643&\b0\frz5.365\pos(431,161.5)}I've gone to the shrine.\N-Yuki
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.24,0:05:04.74,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,The shrine...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:07.49,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Wait, Ms. Yuki's not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.49,0:05:08.00,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.00,0:05:08.94,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.94,0:05:11.94,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I haven't explained anything about Dad to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.94,0:05:13.06,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,You haven't?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:13.87,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:14.66,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:17.90,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,You guys live together! \NYou could have told her any time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:20.92,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Well, just because someone's close by
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.92,0:05:23.25,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,doesn't mean you can just \Ntalk to them about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.25,0:05:24.13,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.53,0:05:28.14,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,That's right. Even with my actual family...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.11,0:05:33.22,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I wasn't able to ask Mom why \Nshe was leaving all of a sudden,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.09,0:05:36.98,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,and I couldn't ask Dad why he \Nlooked the way he did about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.77,0:05:44.53,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,let alone tell him that this was the \Nfirst time I actually felt afraid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.63,0:05:48.96,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,After that, Dad got transferred \Noverseas for work,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:52.88,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,and he rarely came home after that, \Nleaving a babysitter in charge of me instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:56.99,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I still can't bring myself to ask \Nwhy I'm living separately from Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.70,0:06:01.21,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,The anger I saw in his eyes that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.87,0:06:04.65,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I'm terrified of finding out \Nit was because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:11.71,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,That's why I'm honestly afraid \Nof how he'll react to Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.94,0:06:14.40,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Big Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:19.73,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,185)\bord2\fs10\c&H0D100E&\3c&HB1B5B2&\frz328.6\fax-0.45\pos(306,203)}You have a new message from Naka Hikage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.07,0:06:19.36,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Hikage...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:25.23,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs16\bord3\an7\c&H797B74&\3c&HECEDEB&\pos(34,62.5)}I had lots of fun at the shrine today!\NJust now, Ms. Yuki and I parted ways, but...\N\NShe seemed sad from the fortune she received,\Nso please try and cheer her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.23,0:06:27.74,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs22\bord3\an7\c&H797B74&\3c&HECEDEB&\pos(30,30)}so please try and cheer her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.69,0:06:27.39,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Cheer... her up...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.37,0:06:30.11,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I've returned home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.43,0:06:33.03,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, Ms. Yuki, welcome—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.03,0:06:34.29,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Your eyes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:36.54,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I had fun visiting the shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:39.04,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Your eyes are swollen as heck! \NDid something happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:39.79,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.63,0:06:42.75,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Nothing... really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.75,0:06:45.01,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'll go get changed right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.01,0:06:45.59,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.26,0:06:47.13,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.13,0:06:50.67,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Um, my dad will be here soon, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.67,0:06:54.50,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I haven't told him that \Nyou're a former assassin,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:06:57.02,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,or that you wear a maid outfit, \Nor anything like that, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.90,0:07:03.98,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Actually, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.98,0:07:05.02,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Go ahead and get changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:06.84,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.65,0:07:11.13,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,What the heck am I panicking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.95,0:07:16.20,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Trying to hide Ms. Yuki, \Nwho's doing her best to be normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.49,0:07:20.59,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,would be like saying that \NI don't think she's normal at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.85,0:07:24.58,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.58,0:07:25.63,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.97,0:07:30.38,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,No matter what Dad says, \Nit's my turn to protect Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.05,0:07:35.19,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,You've grown so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.35,0:07:38.17,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, but what you said just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:42.58,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,You gotta say that stuff to Ms. Yuki! \NIt's a big, fat waste just saying it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:44.90,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,You idiot! One more time! From the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.90,0:07:47.12,DefaultTop,RIKO,0,0,0,,And I'll get the whole thing on camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.48,0:07:47.34,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Come on! Quit teasing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:49.53,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Starting the new year off with a bang, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.53,0:07:50.40,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Da—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.40,0:07:53.32,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,I see you two are getting along \Nas well as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.32,0:07:55.32,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.32,0:07:56.33,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Welcome home...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:07:57.37,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Good to be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.37,0:07:58.73,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.73,0:08:00.56,Default,ARATA {background},0,0,0,,Riko! Have you been behaving yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:01.58,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I have!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:04.52,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Aw, but why'd you have to go and grow a beard?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.52,0:08:07.72,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,The simple, clean-shaven look \Nis way more popular with the ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.75,0:08:11.62,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Well, the only lady I need \Nto be popular with is you, Riko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:14.18,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,That's my dad. 100,000 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.18,0:08:16.01,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Um, Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.51,0:08:19.85,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's about the maid I mentioned before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.85,0:08:22.94,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Yeah, the new housekeeper, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.94,0:08:24.98,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,The house really is remarkably clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.33,0:08:26.77,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,I'll have to thank her personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.77,0:08:29.57,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,She's not a housekeeper, exactly...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:31.38,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,She's a bona fide maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.74,0:08:38.43,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,And this maid, Ms. Yuki, has some \Nhistory from her previous job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.43,0:08:40.70,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,There's a whole lot I need to explain to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.64,0:08:44.14,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,A maid... named Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.47,0:08:46.79,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.83,0:08:51.92,DefaultItalics,ARATA {M},0,0,0,,"Yuki." A maid's dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.65,0:08:54.29,DefaultItalics,ARATA {M},0,0,0,,An assassin by trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.29,0:08:56.32,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,You're the man from before...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.05,0:08:58.44,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.91,0:09:00.89,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,So you are Ms. Xue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.17,0:09:12.40,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.40,0:09:15.06,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,It was nothing. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:17.17,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,No, you were a great help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.17,0:09:18.09,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.09,0:09:19.05,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Well, glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.05,0:09:20.66,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,It seemed very important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.66,0:09:21.70,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Huh? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.70,0:09:24.17,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,You guys know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.17,0:09:27.32,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,To think you were Master Hitoyoshi's father...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:33.84,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,My apologies, Master Hitoyoshi. \NI should be handling the refreshments...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.84,0:09:34.64,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:35.42,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.42,0:09:36.64,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:42.09,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,So, when did you first \Nstart working for Mr. Hamuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.09,0:09:46.06,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Right. It was about three years ago \Nthat he became my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.35,0:09:49.14,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,He told me of a maid who was also an assassin,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.14,0:09:51.69,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,but I didn't think you'd be this beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:52.73,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Right, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:55.69,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,She's perfect from any angle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.69,0:09:57.65,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Right, Mochita?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.65,0:09:59.53,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,But... Now I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.53,0:10:02.38,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,It's been half a year since \NMr. Hamuro's passing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.90,0:10:06.46,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,He was a brilliant and admirable man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.87,0:10:09.21,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes. It is a great loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.53,0:10:14.65,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,This whole time, I was thinking how \NI'd explain Ms. Yuki to my dad, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.65,0:10:17.25,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,You see, I met him when \NI was working in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.25,0:10:19.13,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,There's a part of Dad I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:21.99,DefaultTop,ARATA,0,0,0,,And the last time we met, \Nabout two years ago, he asked me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.99,0:10:25.10,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,There's a part of Ms. Yuki I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:28.73,DefaultTop,ARATA,0,0,0,,"If I die, there's a girl I'd like you \Nto take in for me."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.65,0:10:30.62,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M/background},0,0,0,,It's almost like I'm listening to a \Nconversation between two strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.73,0:10:31.69,DefaultTop,ARATA,0,0,0,,"Would you treat her as one of your own?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.69,0:10:32.90,DefaultTop,YUKI,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.07,0:10:35.08,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M/background},0,0,0,,Arrangements being made behind my back...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.91,0:10:41.20,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,The feeling that I'm being left behind \Nall on my own again...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.97,0:10:43.24,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,The sting of loneliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.08,0:10:47.13,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,But you knew she was an assassin \Nall along, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.13,0:10:48.76,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you said yes to that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.76,0:10:52.06,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Well, at the time, Mr. Hamuro \Nwas still alive and well,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:54.80,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,and I didn't really think he was serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.80,0:10:56.26,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,And besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.63,0:11:00.34,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,You two inherited your mother's vampire blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:03.12,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,so I figured, what's one \Nlittle assassin gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.12,0:11:05.88,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Ohmigosh! Who knew these charming fangs \Nheld a deeper secret?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.88,0:11:07.10,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Vampire...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.10,0:11:08.64,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.06,0:11:11.35,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,when I dressed up as a vampire \Nlast Halloween...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:14.00,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I thought I felt my blood respond!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.00,0:11:15.91,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Riko, you're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:18.65,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Dad's always been this way, hasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.09,0:11:22.30,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Whenever there's something \Nhe wants to hide or avoid facing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.83,0:11:22.66,DefaultTop,RIKO {background},0,0,0,,What is it, boy? You want a pat, too, Mochita?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.30,0:11:25.00,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,he brushes it off with a joke \Nor remains silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:25.38,DefaultTop,ARATA{background},0,0,0,,Who's a squishy ol' mochi cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:29.12,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,So I gradually stopped prying,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.38,0:11:27.59,DefaultTop,RIKO{background},0,0,0,,I'm happy for you, Mochita!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.55,0:11:30.01,DefaultTop,RIKO{background},0,0,0,,Squishy squish!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.12,0:11:32.63,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,and began to pick up on his cues... Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.54,0:11:38.21,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I get it. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.34,0:11:39.51,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(149,1)\fs16\bord3\an7\c&H797B74&\3c&HECEDEB&\pos(34,62.5)}I had lots of fun at the shrine today!\NJust now, Ms. Yuki and I parted ways, but...\N\NShe seemed sad from the fortune she received,\Nso please try and cheer her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.51,0:11:42.72,Flashback,RIKO,0,0,0,,You gotta say that stuff to Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.29,0:11:48.05,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Back then and even now... I've always kept \Nthings to myself so as not to burden others.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.05,0:11:51.73,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,My dad, Ms. Yuki... I don't tell them anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.73,0:11:55.51,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,And instead of trying to learn about them, \NI just wait for them to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.33,0:11:58.65,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Now then, Riko.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.65,0:11:59.98,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,It's time I took you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.98,0:12:01.74,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,What? Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.74,0:12:04.36,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,I have things I need to speak \Nwith your mother about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.36,0:12:06.68,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,It's Big Brother's birthday, you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:09.58,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Hitoyoshi doesn't like it being celebrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.81,0:12:11.66,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.20,0:12:15.84,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Happy sixteenth birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.84,0:12:17.63,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,This is from your mother and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.49,0:12:19.56,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.59,0:12:25.47,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Sorry to say this after you went through \Nthe trouble of cleaning the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.47,0:12:28.60,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,but I have a work meeting I need to attend, \Nso I'll be staying at a hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.55,0:12:29.33,DefaultTop,RIKO {background},0,0,0,,Squishy, squishy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:29.33,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.33,0:12:30.18,Default,RIKO {background},0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.10,0:12:34.90,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Everything I wanted to say to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.05,0:12:39.38,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Am I just going to leave it all unsaid again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.23,0:12:41.82,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fnArial Black\pos(380,163)}Private
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.83,0:12:43.28,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Well then, see ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:45.86,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H19162D&\3c&HCCCAD6&\pos(627,67)}Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.13,0:12:52.04,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Am I really going to let him go \Nwithout saying anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:56.33,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.78,0:12:58.27,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,This time, I need to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.43,0:13:01.35,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:05.88,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.40,0:13:09.22,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki can stay here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.11,0:13:20.82,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,What do {\i1}you{\i0} want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.45,0:13:24.53,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.52,0:13:33.91,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I want her to stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.02,0:13:42.25,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:45.70,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Well, you're sixteen now. Do as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.63,0:13:49.01,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,I'll gently break the news to your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.65,0:13:50.58,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.77,0:13:58.10,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(66,1)\bord2\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\c&H262433&\3c&H9FA3AF&\frz20.96\fax-0.35\pos(492,132)}Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.46,0:13:59.96,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,For the first time...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:02.64,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Just once, I was able to tell him \Nwhat was on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:07.61,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Was I able to protect Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.70,0:14:11.83,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H151326&\3c&H616171&\fs16\frz5.714\fax-0.15\pos(597,133)}Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.39,0:14:10.44,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:13.79,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,1)\b0\pos(355.5,59.5)\frz347.8\fax-0.05}Incoming Call
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:13.79,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,1)\b0\fs36\frz347.8\fax-0.05\pos(313.5,199)}Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.79,0:14:15.03,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.23,0:14:17.50,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.50,0:14:21.63,DefaultItalics,ARATA,0,0,0,,Sorry, Hitoyoshi. \NWould you mind putting on Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.76,0:14:25.81,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.81,0:14:26.57,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.57,0:14:28.44,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Dad wants to speak to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.50,0:14:32.23,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes, this is Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.64,0:14:33.73,DefaultItalics,ARATA,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.73,0:14:34.57,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.57,0:14:37.06,DefaultItalics,ARATA,0,0,0,,Sorry to put you through all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:39.15,DefaultItalics,ARATA,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to ask in front of him, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.15,0:14:41.48,DefaultItalics,ARATA,0,0,0,,Is there anything unsatisfactory \Nabout your situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:43.40,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm quite all right. Everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:47.23,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi is taking \Nvery good care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.23,0:14:48.24,DefaultItalics,ARATA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.69,0:14:50.70,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.40,0:14:52.91,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,He's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.41,0:14:55.93,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,Or rather, he's trying to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.65,0:14:58.04,Default,ARATA,0,0,0,,And I think that's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.60,0:15:01.00,DefaultItalics,ARATA,0,0,0,,you're by his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.54,0:15:02.46,DefaultItalics,ARATA,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.03,0:15:07.18,DefaultItalics,ARATA,0,0,0,,Please take good care of Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.58,0:15:08.42,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:14.85,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.16,0:15:18.51,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.86,0:15:22.74,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Would you like to go see \Nthe night view with me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.40,0:15:25.13,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh, the night view...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.94,0:15:26.90,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Sure, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.40,0:15:29.61,DefaultTop,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Just where are we—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.40,0:15:29.61,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.61,0:15:31.45,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh? Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.45,0:15:33.53,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\c&H302E3D&\3c&H8F91A0&\frz17.65\fax0.05\move(540,129.5,540,205,22,2065)}Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:34.74,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,M-Ms. Yuki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.43,0:15:38.05,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What's all this, all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.05,0:15:39.16,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.16,0:15:42.04,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's... not quite... night yet... but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.04,0:15:44.10,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,there's a lovely... view of the town... so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.10,0:15:46.56,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You're so out of breath that \Nyou're clutching your chest?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.56,0:15:47.64,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.10,0:15:57.13,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,M-Master Hitoyoshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.63,0:16:00.43,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.92,0:16:04.66,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Don't tell me the reason she was clutching \Nher chest and being all fidgety was...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.71,0:16:21.10,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I just... had to give this to you today...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.70,0:16:22.98,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.02,0:16:27.00,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,And here I was, getting it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.02,0:16:28.80,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.15,0:16:33.93,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,If you always bottle everything up inside, \Nno one else will understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.70,0:16:37.89,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,What I want to tell Ms. Yuki is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.22,0:16:45.84,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,my hopes for our future together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:54.20,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,This is from an anime that got kinda popular \Nten years ago. I was massively into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:57.79,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I was always whining selfishly to my dad \Nto get me merchandise from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.79,0:17:00.20,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi... being selfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.18,0:17:02.37,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.73,0:17:03.47,DefaultTop,ARATA {background},0,0,0,,Up you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.25,0:17:06.37,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,When I was little, I used to look up to my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.93,0:17:10.30,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It was like he knew everything \Nand could do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.57,0:17:18.09,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,To me, my dad was the first hero I ever knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.41,0:17:21.61,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,But ever since the day my mom left,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.61,0:17:24.06,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,it was like I didn't know \Nanything about my dad anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.10,0:17:29.52,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It really sucks to look up to someone, only to \Nhave it all come crashing down, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.90,0:17:31.80,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Even now, I'm afraid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.80,0:17:35.99,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I'd worry, like... What if I was honest \Nwith him and he just shut me down?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.67,0:17:39.29,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I didn't want to be hurt any more \Nthan I already was, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.45,0:17:43.87,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I spent ten years avoiding him, \Nand then I realized
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.87,0:17:46.92,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,that I didn't know how we \Ncould be a family anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:49.78,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.64,0:17:54.67,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I don't want that to happen with you, Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.63,0:18:03.54,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,If you came here to find a family of your own, \Nthen that's what I want to be for you—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.29,0:18:06.98,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,someone you can talk to about \Nthe happy times, the sad times,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.53,0:18:12.08,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,anything and everything in-between—as family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.71,0:18:16.58,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Would you be part of my family?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.05,0:18:29.37,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,And I know I'm being kinda formal \Nabout this out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.37,0:18:31.98,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Like, as far as everyone else is concerned, \Nwe're already cousins,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.98,0:18:33.90,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,so it's like, why even ask, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.85,0:18:36.01,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.30,0:18:39.64,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,D-Did I say something I shouldn't have?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.64,0:18:41.64,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,No. My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.34,0:18:48.59,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,How peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.55,0:18:52.31,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It seems that tears still flow...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.37,0:18:55.66,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,even in times of happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.47,0:19:01.79,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I would love to be part of your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.78,0:19:04.41,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Is that really possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.99,0:19:07.10,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,For someone like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.96,0:19:13.22,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,A-Absolutely! In fact, it has \Nto be you, and only you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.22,0:19:14.12,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:18.48,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I love you, Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.60,0:19:34.17,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Of course! I love you, too, Master Hitoyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.55,0:19:36.31,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.46,0:20:00.69,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,So this is how my New Year's turmoil ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.69,0:20:02.31,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's better this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.01,0:20:08.85,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,If that's what it takes to preserve \NMs. Yuki's innocent, childlike smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.16,0:20:17.69,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I already knew that Ms. Yuki's "love" \Nis more like "endearment," but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.52,0:20:29.48,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I think this is the first time \NI've experienced real heartbreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.35,0:20:52.89,Flashback,HITOYOSHI {flashback},0,0,0,,I love you, Ms. Yuki!
